<title>HUNGARY: TENNIS-BUDAPEST WOMEN'S OPEN QUARTER FINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-BUDAPEST WOMEN'S OPEN QUARTER FINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter final results in the</p>
<p>$107,500 Budapest Women's Open tennis tournament on Thursday</p>
<p>(prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>2-Amanda Coetzer (South Africa) beat Elena Wagner (Germany) 6-1 6-7 6-2</p>
<p>1-Karina Habsudova (Slovakia) beat 8-Alexandra Fusai (France) 6-4 6-3</p>
<p>7-Henrieta Nagyova (Slovakia) beat Joanette Kruger (South Africa) 4-6 6-4 6-3</p>
<p>4-Sabine Appelmans (Belgium) beat Cristina Torrens-Valero (Spain) 6-4 6-4</p>
</text>
